{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/f/98fd864cd66bb1c6940175a9188166e9c9938a0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=(x-1)^4+4(x-1)^3+6(x-1)^2+4(x-1)+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"406\" height=\"19\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/e/9ce617cd13fa38c1469746378e1c68bac38f1660.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ (x-2)^4 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ (x-1)^4 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ x^4 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ (x+1)^4 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ x^4+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"559\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/7/b374f60240b1c6a5d97f85a9d5ff973d54068c3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />.  Substitution results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/8/43815d981fba2bc62ed1649641f8538a8ea1b86c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S = y^4 + 4y^3 + 6y^2 + 4y + 1\\]\" width=\"220\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/6/3a68e57d0b438c214700d43cfce82cee6ecf8010.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S = (y+1)^4\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"19\" />\nSubstituting back results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea4b6399335f691d78233ab83492a507caefbafe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S = x^4\\]\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.  This problem can also be solved by traditionally expanding and combining like terms (though it would take much longer).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>By Ajeet Dubey | <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ioqm.in\">ioqm.in</a></i>\n</p><p>The coefficients <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/5/a9549d715c41e7731be417e995ddb7e33f0f0651.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,4,6,4,1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" /> are the binomial coefficients in the expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/0/44065b4034c1a6579c21e8640afed07fa78c9b0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(u+1)^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"65\" height=\"21\" />. Taking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/3/a73867361429d53afaf33bf476213bd083b19746.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u=x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />, the given expression is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/d/40dcbfc7d9b09424db21674b52d8d4b80474cdbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-1)^4+4(x-1)^3+6(x-1)^2+4(x-1)+1=((x-1)+1)^4=x^4.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"553\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1